# Default options for `act` (https://github.com/nektos/act), which runs the
# GitHub Actions workflows in .github/workflows locally.
#
# catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest is the medium-sized runner image; it carries
# enough of the real ubuntu-latest tooling to install Lua and luarocks.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest

# Keep act's own artifact/cache traffic out of the working tree.
--artifact-server-path /tmp/act-artifacts

# Don't bind-mount the container daemon's socket into the job container. The
# jobs never need nested containers, and under Podman on macOS the socket
# lives on the host rather than in the VM, so the mount fails outright.
--container-daemon-socket -
